                    <div class="activity-comments-top hide-for-small-only hide-for-medium-only hide-for-large-only">
    <h3 class="activity-comments-top__title">Latest reviews</h3>
    <ul class="activity-comments-top__list">
                                                
            <li class="activity-comments-top__list__element">
                                                                                <a href="/en/fez/merzouga-desert-trip/" class="activity-comments-top__list__element__title" title="Merzouga Desert 2-Day Trip">Merzouga Desert 2-Day Trip</a>
                                                                                                    <div class="activity-comments-top__list__element__rating">
                    <div class="m-rating  m-rating__stars__container">
                        <span class="m-rating__stars" title="valoración: 8.00">
                            <span class="m-rating__stars__empty"></span>
                            <span class="m-rating__stars__full" style="width: 80% !important">8.00</span>
                        </span>
                        <span class="a-text--rating-total">
                            04/14/2026
                        </span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                                                <div class="activity-comments-top__list__element__name">Roberta</div>
                                                                    <div class="activity-comments-top__list__element__location">
                        <div class="b-flag b-flag_gb"></div>                        Reading                        ,                         United Kingdom                    </div>
                                                                                                                        <p class="activity-comments-top__list__element__text">Overall, a very positive experience. Our driver, Moha, was extremely kind: always available, patient, polite, and helpful. The desert camp was nice, well-equipped, and served a delicious dinner. The camel ride was also well-organized. The only negative was the camp manager, who didn&#039;t appreciate our decision to return by camel instead of paying the extra fee for the jeep. Initially, he insisted we leave before dawn.</p>
                                                                                                            <div class="activity-comments-top__list__element__type">
                                        <div class="viajas-fam-hijos-mayores"><span class="__inner">I travelled with teenagers</span></div>
                </div>
                            </li>
                                                
            <li class="activity-comments-top__list__element">
                                                                                <a href="/en/marrakech/sahara-desert-tour/" class="activity-comments-top__list__element__title" title="3-Day Sahara Desert Tour">3-Day Sahara Desert Tour</a>
                                                                                                    <div class="activity-comments-top__list__element__rating">
                    <div class="m-rating  m-rating__stars__container">
                        <span class="m-rating__stars" title="valoración: 10.00">
                            <span class="m-rating__stars__empty"></span>
                            <span class="m-rating__stars__full" style="width: 100% !important">10.00</span>
                        </span>
                        <span class="a-text--rating-total">
                            04/10/2026
                        </span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                                                <div class="activity-comments-top__list__element__name">Oliver</div>
                                                                    <div class="activity-comments-top__list__element__location">
                        <div class="b-flag b-flag_gb"></div>                                                                        United Kingdom                    </div>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    <div class="activity-comments-top__list__element__type">
                                        <div class="viajas-fam-hijos-peques"><span class="__inner">I travelled with small children</span></div>
                </div>
                            </li>
                                                
            <li class="activity-comments-top__list__element">
                                                                                <a href="/en/marrakech/sahara-desert-tour/" class="activity-comments-top__list__element__title" title="3-Day Sahara Desert Tour">3-Day Sahara Desert Tour</a>
                                                                                                    <div class="activity-comments-top__list__element__rating">
                    <div class="m-rating  m-rating__stars__container">
                        <span class="m-rating__stars" title="valoración: 10.00">
                            <span class="m-rating__stars__empty"></span>
                            <span class="m-rating__stars__full" style="width: 100% !important">10.00</span>
                        </span>
                        <span class="a-text--rating-total">
                            02/13/2026
                        </span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                                                <div class="activity-comments-top__list__element__name">Sara</div>
                                                                    <div class="activity-comments-top__list__element__location">
                        <div class="b-flag b-flag_it"></div>                                                                        Italy                    </div>
                                                                                                                        <p class="activity-comments-top__list__element__text">An incredible experience, beautiful landscapes. Mohammed, the man who accompanied us, was a great driver and spoke several languages equally well: Italian, English, and Spanish. The hours in the minibus are long, but the landscapes we pass through are well worth it. A night in the desert requires warm clothing because the tents aren&#039;t heated, as is the dawn dune crossing on camels.</p>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            <div class="activity-comments-top__list__element__type">
                                        <div class="viajas-amigos"><span class="__inner">I travelled with friends</span></div>
                </div>
                            </li>
                    </ul>
</div>
                </div>
