    <div class="poi-footer__content">
                <h2 class="poi-footer__title">More information</h2>
                <div class="poi-footer__text">
        <p>Visiting the Merzouga Desert is a hugely popular experience for travellers to Morocco. Experience a unique culture, and incredible nature, in one!</p>

<p>What to do in the Merzouga desert?</p>

<ul>
	<li><strong>Camel trekking at sunset</strong>: an iconic experience that lets you admire the changing colours of the dunes.</li>
	<li><strong>Spend a night in a traditional Berber camp</strong>: enjoy an authentic experience under a starry sky.</li>
	<li><strong>Sandboarding</strong>: surf the dunes!</li>
	<li><strong>Quad biking</strong></li>
	<li><strong>4x4 tour&nbsp;</strong></li>
</ul>

<h3>Discover Berber culture</h3>

<p>The Merzouga desert is the ideal place to discover Berber culture. Visit the local villages and discover the daily life of the desert's inhabitants. Join in an evening around the fire with traditional music and traditional&nbsp;dishes like&nbsp;<strong>tajine </strong>and <strong>couscous</strong>! Also, be sure to visit the <strong>Rissani market</strong>, where you can buy handcrafted souvenirs and local spices.</p>

        </div>
    </div>

</section>                                                                                                                        
<div class="farm-sections-container">
            <section class="l-farm-section farm-section hide-if-show-calendar">
            <h2 class="a-title-farm-section">
                Other interesting attractions in Merzouga
            </h2>
            <div class="activity-farm-section">
                                    <a class="a-farm-link"
                       href="/en/marrakech/jemaa-el-fnaa/"
                       title="Jemaa el-Fnaa Square"
                       data-farm-link
                                              data-navigation-click='{"category": "poi_linkfarm_related_poi", "action": "click_link", "label": "/en/marrakech/jemaa-el-fnaa/"}'>
                        Jemaa el-Fnaa Square
                    </a>
                            </div>
                    </section>
    </div>

<script>
    (function () {
        var farmTitles = document.querySelectorAll('.a-title-farm-section');
        farmTitles.forEach(function (title) {
            title.addEventListener('click', function () {
                if (window.matchMedia('(min-width: 770px)').matches) return;
                var farmSection = title.nextElementSibling;
                farmSection.style.maxHeight = farmSection.style.maxHeight ? '' : farmSection.scrollHeight + 'px';
                title.classList.toggle('_open');
            });
        });

        function computeCollapsedState(section) {
            var links = Array.prototype.slice.call(section.querySelectorAll('[data-farm-link]'));
            if (!links.length) return false;

            var rowTops = links.reduce(function (acc, link) {
                var top = link.offsetTop;
                if (acc.indexOf(top) === -1) acc.push(top);
                return acc;
            }, []);

            if (rowTops.length <= 2) return false;

            var prevLast = section.querySelector('._last-visible-farm-link');
            if (prevLast) prevLast.classList.remove('_last-visible-farm-link');

            var thirdRowTop = rowTops[2];
            var lastVisibleLink = null;
            links.forEach(function (link) {
                if (link.offsetTop < thirdRowTop) lastVisibleLink = link;
            });
            if (!lastVisibleLink) return false;
            lastVisibleLink.classList.add('_last-visible-farm-link');

            var sectionRect = section.getBoundingClientRect();
            var lastVisibleBottom = lastVisibleLink.getBoundingClientRect().bottom;
            section.dataset.collapsedHeight = lastVisibleBottom - sectionRect.top;
            return true;
        }

        requestAnimationFrame(function () {
            if (!window.matchMedia('(min-width: 770px)').matches) return;
            document.querySelectorAll('.activity-farm-section').forEach(function (section) {
                if (!computeCollapsedState(section)) return;
                section.style.maxHeight = section.dataset.collapsedHeight + 'px';
                var btn = section.closest('section').querySelector('[data-farm-more-button]');
                if (btn) btn.classList.add('_farm-more-active');
            });
        });

        document.querySelectorAll('[data-farm-more-button]').forEach(function (btn) {
            btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
                var section = btn.closest('section').querySelector('.activity-farm-section');
                if (btn.classList.contains('_farm-more-expanded')) {
                    computeCollapsedState(section);
                    section.style.maxHeight = section.dataset.collapsedHeight + 'px';
                    btn.textContent = btn.dataset.textShowAll;
                    btn.classList.remove('_farm-more-expanded');
                } else {
                    section.style.maxHeight = '';
                    btn.textContent = btn.dataset.textShowLess;
                    btn.classList.add('_farm-more-expanded');
                }
            });
        });

        var resizeTimeout;
        window.addEventListener('resize', function () {
            clearTimeout(resizeTimeout);
            resizeTimeout = setTimeout(function () {
                if (!window.matchMedia('(min-width: 770px)').matches) return;
                document.querySelectorAll('.activity-farm-section').forEach(function (section) {
                    var btn = section.closest('section').querySelector('[data-farm-more-button]');
                    if (!btn || btn.classList.contains('_farm-more-expanded')) return;
                    if (computeCollapsedState(section)) {
                        section.style.maxHeight = section.dataset.collapsedHeight + 'px';
                    }
                });
            }, 150);
        });

        var links = document.querySelectorAll('[data-navigation-click]');
        links.forEach(function (element) {
            element.addEventListener('click', function () {
                try {
                    var data = JSON.parse(element.getAttribute('data-navigation-click'));
                    if (!data.category || !data.action || !data.label) return;
                    window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
                    window.dataLayer.push({
                        event: 'navigation_clic',
                        event_category: data.category,
                        event_action: data.action,
                        event_label: data.label,
                        userId: null
                    });
                } catch (e) {}
            });
        });
    })();
</script>
                                            
